+\paragraph{Predictions.} Tables~\ref{tab:predictions} and~\ref{tab:predictions-b} score every registered prediction from the report. For Q4-b, the original scoring script compared the report's raw component $p$-values, although the prediction is registered on calibrated values; the corrected script compares the calibrated values, \site{r_pred_q4b_g} against \site{r_pred_q4b_e} on each of fresh0, fresh2, and fresh5. The prediction remains fulfilled and the total is unchanged: a scoring correctio
